OL,3,GNEWSAObama receives honorary degree
OL,4,Afrom Queen's University Belfast
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer US President Barack Obama has
OL,7,Fbeen awarded an honorary degree from
OL,8,FQueen's University Belfast (QUB).
OL,10,FReceiving his doctorate, the 44th US
OL,11,Fpresident praised Northern Ireland's
OL,12,Fprogress and challenged the next
OL,13,Fgeneration to continue building a
OL,14,Fpeaceful and inclusive future.
OL,16,FThe Good Friday Agreement peace
OL,17,Fagreement "is still a shining example
OL,18,Fof what can happen when people put
OL,19,Faside old wounds and choose peace," he
OL,20,Ftold university staff and students.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
